'''The Art of Pokémon Adventures 2016 Con Exclusive''' (Japanese: '''ポケットモンスターSPECIAL イラスト集: PokeSP Illustrations''' ''Pocket Monsters SPECIAL Illustrations'') is a mini art book featuring full-color illustrations by [[Satoshi Yamamoto]] for the [[Pokémon Adventures]] {{pkmn|manga}}. It includes 68 illustrations numbered #00 through #67 across 64 pages, twelve of which were not previously published (#00, #02, #25, #27, #28, #36, #38, #42, #44, #46, #47, and #53).<ref>[http://karubiimu.blog.jp/archives/4598103.html ポケスペ第50巻の初版限定特別版に付属しているイラスト集 : かるビームのブログ]</ref>

In Japan, the book was included as a supplement with the limited edition release of {{PAV|50}} in 2014. In North America, the book was sold for $15 at the [[VIZ Media]] booth at the 2016 {{wp|San Diego Comic-Con}} and {{wp|New York Comic Con}} 2016.<ref>[https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/press-release/2016-07-13/viz-media-details-pokemon-adventures-creator-events-at-2016-comic-con-international/.104289 Viz Media Details Pokémon Adventures Creator Events at 2016 Comic-Con International - Anime News Network]</ref><ref>[https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/press-release/2016-10-03/viz-media-announces-unique-activities-and-special-convention-exclusives-for-new-york-comic-con-2016/.107203 Viz Media Announces Unique Activities and Special Convention Exclusives for New York Comic Con 2016 - Anime News Network]</ref> In mainland China, the book and 12 postcards were included as a bonus with the {{PAV|1}}–{{PAV|61|61}} [[Manga boxed sets#1-61|boxed set]].<ref>[https://detail.tmall.com/item.htm?id=744880682837 【新包装】精灵宝可梦1-61特别篇神奇宝贝黑白漫画漫画书二次元日漫书 漫画榜日本漫画吉林美术出版社-tmall.com天猫]</ref>

